# OmniHotel OS | Enterprise Operations ERP & Ambient Middleware

An enterprise-grade, high-density Property Management and Operations ERP engineered to eliminate manual data entry, optimize labor overhead, and maximize asset lifecycles. Inspired by industry-leading ServiceNow workflow design, **OmniHotel OS** introduces an "Invisible Operational Layer" that bridges real-world physical asset telemetries natively with predictive cloud analytics.

## 🏗 Architectural Blueprint & Stack

This platform features a fully decoupled, production-ready enterprise deployment pipeline:

*   **Frontend Command Center:** Next.js 14 (App Router), TypeScript, Tailwind CSS, and shadcn/ui. Architected with an ultra-dense, slate-toned dark design system optimized for high-throughput Mission Critical operations.
*   **Database Infrastructure:** Cloud-hosted Supabase PostgreSQL featuring strict relational integrity, branch isolation, and Row-Level Security (RLS) enforcement.
*   **Automation Layer:** Native database-level PL/pgSQL triggers that offload compute overhead from the client to the database engine.
*   **CI/CD Pipeline:** Automated integration loop cascading from Lovable AI IDE ➡️ GitHub Repository Version Streams ➡️ Vercel Edge Networks.

